@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@breweryId = 1
@boundary = ----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
@longCaption = 

# Toute réponse 2xx est enveloppée : charge utile sous `data`. Toute erreur
# rend `{ error }`, une string. Un 400 y ajoute `details`.
#
# `photo` requis (multer + garde `requirePhoto`), `caption` optionnel
# (`NewPhoto`, trim, 1-255 caractères si présent).

### setup — bière jetable à illustrer dans les scénarios ci-dessous
# @name createTemp
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Temp {{$randomInt 1 1000000}}",
  "brewery_id": {{breweryId}}
}

### setup — récupération de la bière jetable
GET {{baseUrl}}/beers/{{createTemp.response.body.data.id}}


### NOMINAL — upload avec caption → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers/{{createTemp.response.body.data.id}}/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="bier.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../db/img/bier.png
--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

Une bière bien fraîche
--{{boundary}}--

### NOMINAL — upload sans caption (optionnel) → 201, caption: null
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers/{{createTemp.response.body.data.id}}/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="bier.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../db/img/bier.png
--{{boundary}}--

### EDGE — sans fichier photo → 400, photo requis
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers/{{createTemp.response.body.data.id}}/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

Sans fichier
--{{boundary}}--

### EDGE — mimetype hors whitelist → 415
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers/{{createTemp.response.body.data.id}}/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

pas une image
--{{boundary}}--

### EDGE — caption trop longue (>255) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers/{{createTemp.response.body.data.id}}/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="bier.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../db/img/bier.png
--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

{{longCaption}}
--{{boundary}}--

### EDGE — caption vide → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers/{{createTemp.response.body.data.id}}/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="bier.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../db/img/bier.png
--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"


--{{boundary}}--

### EDGE — champ inconnu dans le body → 400, schéma strict
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers/{{createTemp.response.body.data.id}}/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="bier.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../db/img/bier.png
--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="color"

blonde
--{{boundary}}--

### EDGE — bière inexistante → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers/999999/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="bier.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../db/img/bier.png
--{{boundary}}--

### EDGE — id non numérique → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/beers/abc/photos
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary={{boundary}}

--{{boundary}}
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="photo"; filename="bier.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../db/img/bier.png
--{{boundary}}--
